Source: wayle
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://wayle.app/
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/wayle-rs/wayle.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/wayle-rs/wayle

Package: wayle
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 hicolor-icon-theme,
 libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0,
 libgstreamer1.0-0,
 libpam0g,
 libpipewire-0.3-0t64 | libpipewire-0.3-0,
 libgbm1
Recommends:
 xdg-desktop-portal,
 gstreamer1.0-pipewire,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-base,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly,
 gstreamer1.0-libav
Suggests:
 dbus-user-session,
 bluez,
 network-manager,
 upower,
 power-profiles-daemon,
 pipewire-pulse,
 wireplumber
Description: Wayland Elements desktop shell
 Wayland Elements is a compositor agnostic shell with extensive customization.
 It includes a bar, notifications, OSD, wallpaper, a launcher, a lock screen,
 a greetd greeter, an xdg-desktop-portal backend, and device controls.
 .
 The binaries are static Go; they load GLib, GStreamer, PAM, PipeWire and
 GBM at runtime.
